#sortorder:9
#showas:复仇觉醒
A rather fun and odd scenario. An increased number of factions, and it's set to difficulty 7.
This difficulty is good for someone who has spent some time in AI War 2.

This is on the "encapsulated" map type, with 90 planets. Full Ensemble AI type.  Basic as you get!
Your starting fleet is set to "Cloaked," which is all about being sneaky, bypassing AI forces and hitting vital targets, as well as shooting from safety.

There are three factions here, but the Dark Spire are the main focus, being at Intensity 8!

The Dark Spire have Vengeance Generators on a few planets, which absorb energy from units that die there, and uses it to warp in ships to cause havoc; if left unchecked, it can create new Generators, and be a very large problem.

Macrophages, which are giant space bug Harvesters that destroy ships for metal, and return it to their homes, creating new Harvesters and spreading to other planets.

The Zenith Trader is also wandering around as a neutral third party, selling big weapons and defensive items to you or the AI as it goes. Make sure to visit the Build tab when it is on one of your planets.

The interesting part is the interaction the Dark Spire have with the Macrophages. The latter will roam the galaxy, destroying ships in their path...which can trigger the Dark Spire to spawn. It's entirely possible to find AI planets devoid of any defenders, as well as terrifying packs of Dark Spire roaming around.

They can get a little out of hand though!